      "Upgrade§NOS Booster": {
        "stats": {
          "Ammo": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "Cost": {
            "value": 6
          }
        },
        "text": "Once per activation, at the start of a Movement Step, this vehicle may declare that it is using a NOS Booster. If it does, this vehicle makes an immediate forced, Long Straight move forward, and then gains strain markers until it has 5 strain markers. It then resolves its Movement Step as normal, except that it may not reverse. Then, at the end of the movement step, it again gains Strain Markers until it has 5 Strain Markers."
      },
